        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6vEDPyi8Y8NeyJ9mn62lQ-vzyC0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12580-coconut-custard-pie-i-VAT-step-03-01-4dc52961538a4db7a90ce342bc0d616b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12580/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour filling into unbaked pie crust. Sprinkle top with 1 tablespoon coconut flakes.",
